00:20:21,119 --> 00:20:21,920
You first.

300
00:20:27,359 --> 00:20:28,000
This is for you.

301
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:33,680
Your prize for beating Sports Academy.

302
00:20:40,480 --> 00:20:41,400
Headphones.

303
00:20:42,839 --> 00:20:44,240
A new model.

304
00:20:45,240 --> 00:20:46,119
I wanted to give it to you

305
00:20:46,119 --> 00:20:47,240
when we were eating last time.

306
00:20:58,200 --> 00:20:58,920
Thanks.

307
00:21:00,880 --> 00:21:01,880
I'm glad you like it.

308
00:21:09,079 --> 00:21:09,680
Okay.

309
00:21:09,839 --> 00:21:10,640
I'll go first.

310
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:11,920
Wait.

311
00:21:15,200 --> 00:21:16,400
Let's go back together.

312
00:21:19,480 --> 00:21:20,319
I'll call a taxi.

313
00:21:23,559 --> 00:21:24,200
Okay.

314
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:24,799
Let's go.

315
00:21:25,119 --> 00:21:25,680
Okay.

316
00:21:39,440 --> 00:21:40,319
Li Haoyu.

317
00:21:41,599 --> 00:21:42,200
Dad.

318
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,720
You're still up?

319
00:21:47,319 --> 00:21:48,160
Put your backpack down.

320
00:21:53,440 --> 00:21:54,160
What's wrong?

321
00:21:54,599 --> 00:21:55,240
Stand straight.

322
00:21:59,119 --> 00:22:00,240
Stand straight.

323
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:04,680
You're back so late.

324
00:22:06,079 --> 00:22:07,559
I just went to a party with my classmates.

325
00:22:08,440 --> 00:22:09,759
Just a party today?

326
00:22:11,480 --> 00:22:12,759
Nothing else?

327
00:22:15,359 --> 00:22:17,160
You're a smart boy.

328
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,640
Do you want me to tell you

329
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,920
or do you want to tell me yourself?

330
00:22:22,920 --> 00:22:24,200
I'm telling you.

331
00:22:26,240 --> 00:22:27,960
A parent

332
00:22:29,000 --> 00:22:30,200
from Yudong

333
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:32,200
called me today.

334
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:35,799
You mean the Yudong thing?

335
00:22:37,359 --> 00:22:38,880
When the Yudong people came to school,

336
00:22:39,680 --> 00:22:40,839
there was some

337
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,680
dispute.

338
00:22:43,079 --> 00:22:44,000
And then?

339
00:22:44,880 --> 00:22:45,960
Then...

340
00:22:48,000 --> 00:22:48,880
Then...

341
00:22:55,000 --> 00:22:56,039
Then they got physical.

342
00:22:59,319 --> 00:23:00,119
I told you,

343
00:23:05,319 --> 00:23:07,319
when you were a kid,

344
00:23:08,319 --> 00:23:10,079
if there's a problem, talk it out.

345
00:23:10,079 --> 00:23:11,079
If not, go to the teacher.

346
00:23:11,079 --> 00:23:12,240
If still not, come to me.

347
00:23:13,160 --> 00:23:16,440
Fighting is the sign of weakness.

348
00:23:16,680 --> 00:23:18,640
You are my son, Li Jianye,

349
00:23:19,400 --> 00:23:21,160
not some street thug.

350
00:23:21,640 --> 00:23:21,920
But

351
00:23:21,920 --> 00:23:23,400
they started it first.

352
00:23:23,400 --> 00:23:24,200
So you hit them.

353
00:23:24,680 --> 00:23:25,400
What if you encounter

354
00:23:25,400 --> 00:23:26,160
similar problems in the future?

355
00:23:26,160 --> 00:23:27,359
Will you always resort to violence?

356
00:23:28,480 --> 00:23:29,519
What will happen to you in the future?

357
00:23:29,519 --> 00:23:30,759
When you grow up,

358
00:23:30,759 --> 00:23:32,400
the police will have enough evidence to arrest you.

359
00:23:32,759 --> 00:23:33,759
You will have a criminal record.

360
00:23:34,240 --> 00:23:35,279
Then,

361
00:23:36,680 --> 00:23:38,200
you will be a social pariah.

362
00:23:40,359 --> 00:23:41,160
Scum.

363
00:23:42,200 --> 00:23:43,799
Dad, how can you say that to me?

364
00:23:43,799 --> 00:23:45,000
What do you want me to say about you?

365
00:23:45,000 --> 00:23:46,640
Look at what you are doing now.

366
00:23:47,279 --> 00:23:48,680
You don't go home every day.

367
00:23:48,680 --> 00:23:50,079
You hang out with these people.

368
00:23:50,079 --> 00:23:51,160
You say you want to make a

369
00:23:51,160 --> 00:23:53,200
name for yourself, and that's okay.

370
00:23:53,200 --> 00:23:54,200
I've heard that

371
00:23:54,880 --> 00:23:56,680
Yudong is the provincial champion.

372
00:23:56,680 --> 00:23:57,559
What about you?

373
00:23:58,920 --> 00:23:59,799
Listen,

374
00:23:59,799 --> 00:24:00,640
I don't care

375
00:24:00,640 --> 00:24:01,720
how well you play.

376
00:24:02,200 --> 00:24:04,400
You just focus on

377
00:24:04,400 --> 00:24:05,759
finishing your studies.

378
00:24:05,759 --> 00:24:06,559
If not,

379
00:24:06,839 --> 00:24:07,359
you'll drop out.

380
00:24:07,359 --> 00:24:08,200
Stop playing.

381
00:24:09,000 --> 00:24:10,519
Why are you saying that about them?

382
00:24:10,839 --> 00:24:11,799
Because I'm your dad.

383
00:24:11,799 --> 00:24:13,200
You're not my dad.

384
00:24:13,759 --> 00:24:14,519
What did you say?

385
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:16,039
Even if they're not good,

386
00:24:16,559 --> 00:24:17,319
when we're in trouble,

387
00:24:17,319 --> 00:24:18,279
we face it together.

388
00:24:18,880 --> 00:24:19,880
When I had a fever,

389
00:24:19,880 --> 00:24:21,079
they took care of me.

390
00:24:21,559 --> 00:24:22,319
Where were you?

391
00:24:26,599 --> 00:24:27,640
I'm working hard

392
00:24:27,640 --> 00:24:29,680
to make money for you.

393
00:24:34,039 --> 00:24:35,319
Listen, Li Haoyu,

394
00:24:37,279 --> 00:24:39,319
you will meet many classmates,

395
00:24:39,799 --> 00:24:42,400
friends,

396
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,000
and buddies in your life.

397
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:48,400
But remember,

398
00:24:48,960 --> 00:24:50,440
never compare them

399
00:24:50,440 --> 00:24:51,799
to your dad.

400
00:24:52,039 --> 00:24:52,920
Son,

401
00:24:53,559 --> 00:24:54,920
in this world,

402
00:24:55,839 --> 00:24:57,039
the one who gives you money

403
00:24:57,039 --> 00:24:58,880
without asking for anything in return

404
00:25:01,160 --> 00:25:02,759
is your true love.

405
00:25:07,759 --> 00:25:09,200
You haven't answered my question.

406
00:25:09,200 --> 00:25:10,119
What question?

407
00:25:10,440 --> 00:25:12,319
Where were you when I had a fever?

408
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,839
When did you have a fever?

409
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:20,519
See,

410
00:25:21,279 --> 00:25:22,119
you don't even know

411
00:25:22,119 --> 00:25:23,319
when I had a fever.

412
00:25:26,720 --> 00:25:28,279
Did you get hurt in the fight?

413
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,920
Now you're showing concern.

414
00:25:30,279 --> 00:25:31,440
Cut down on the alcohol.
